{"id":"twitter:2007977146900480303","tweet_id":"2007977146900480303","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007977146900480303","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas Shipping gets expensive too, I use a really cheap basal wood so I can send non-machineable first class, but about 25% get","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas Shipping gets expensive too, I use a really cheap basal wood so I can send non-machineable first class, but about 25% get lost in the mail and never make it., If I do priority parcels, suddenly I need to do customs, and the cost skyrockets cheaper to just redo and try again","date":"2026-01-05","published":"2026-01-05T00:47:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/2007976529897324993","reply_tweet_id":"2007976529897324993","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas Shipping gets expensive too, I use a really cheap basal wood so I can send non-machineable first class, but about 25% get lost in the mail and never make it.,<br><br>If I do priority parcels, suddenly I need to do customs, and the cost skyrockets<br><br>cheaper to just redo and try again</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007977146900480303","display_date":"January 05, 2026 · 00:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
