{"id":"twitter:2007975812054614275","tweet_id":"2007975812054614275","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007975812054614275","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas And nib tips are the step up, if you really want to do precision line work and shading, plus you get variable temperature","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas And nib tips are the step up, if you really want to do precision line work and shading, plus you get variable temperature settings I keep saying I will save up, but it makes no sense when I can just keep donating the money I save https://t.co/Ka612UGiXu","date":"2026-01-05","published":"2026-01-05T00:41:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007968754966376724","reply_tweet_id":"2007968754966376724","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas And nib tips are the step up, if you really want to do precision line work and shading, plus you get variable temperature settings<br><br>I keep saying I will save up, but it makes no sense when I can just keep donating the money I save <a href=\"https://t.co/Ka612UGiXu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Ka612UGiXu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0b87eaa4d3191dd599eddae130546d6e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007975812054614275","display_date":"January 05, 2026 · 00:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0b87eaa4d3191dd599eddae130546d6e.jpg"]}
