{"id":"twitter:2007973853977595995","tweet_id":"2007973853977595995","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007973853977595995","title":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas OMG those go so hard. Now I want to try, really just an amateur. Insignia are easier because it's a ton of solid colors I","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas OMG those go so hard. Now I want to try, really just an amateur. Insignia are easier because it's a ton of solid colors I got a few special orders for tribbles to honor undertow, but I am still practicing fur. Wish I had a nib burner, but I use a solid pen (solder iron)","date":"2026-01-05","published":"2026-01-05T00:34:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/2007972950281224492","reply_tweet_id":"2007972950281224492","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 @Brad_R_Thomas OMG those go so hard. Now I want to try,<br><br>really just an amateur. Insignia are easier because it&#x27;s a ton of solid colors<br><br>I got a few special orders for tribbles to honor undertow, but I am still practicing fur.<br><br>Wish I had a nib burner, but I use a solid pen (solder iron)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007973853977595995","display_date":"January 05, 2026 · 00:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
