{"id":"twitter:2007950204415406395","tweet_id":"2007950204415406395","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007950204415406395","title":"@SwiftOnSecurity My other design tip is to look at Creative Commons images on Flickr. You can match to your color pattern in the Filter. Get a ton of ","summary":"@SwiftOnSecurity My other design tip is to look at Creative Commons images on Flickr. You can match to your color pattern in the Filter. Get a ton of affordable art this way. If you don't want to pay for framing (hundreds) go to Goodwill and buy a painting/photo with right frame size","date":"2026-01-04","published":"2026-01-04T23:00:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007865545027449129","reply_tweet_id":"2007865545027449129","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SwiftOnSecurity My other design tip is to look at Creative Commons images on Flickr.<br><br>You can match to your color pattern in the Filter.<br><br>Get a ton of affordable art this way.<br><br>If you don&#x27;t want to pay for framing (hundreds) go to Goodwill and buy a painting/photo with right frame size</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007950204415406395","display_date":"January 04, 2026 · 23:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
